<figure class="chapter-visual born-huang-diagram">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：Born–Huang 电子通道展开</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: the Born-Huang electronic-channel expansion</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="born-huang-title born-huang-desc">
    <title id="born-huang-title">Expansion of a coupled electron-nuclear state into electronic channels</title>
    <desc id="born-huang-desc">
      Electronic eigenstates depend parametrically on nuclear coordinates. Nuclear channel amplitudes multiply those states. Nuclear kinetic energy differentiates both factors and creates diagonal and off-diagonal derivative couplings.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="channel-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="born-huang-diagram__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(34 40)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="225" height="102" rx="12" class="born-huang-diagram__box" />
      <text x="112" y="30" text-anchor="middle">fixed-R electronic problem</text>
      <text x="112" y="58" text-anchor="middle">Ĥₑ(R) Ψᵢ(r;R)=Eᵢ(R)Ψᵢ</text>
      <text x="112" y="84" text-anchor="middle">每个核构型的一组完备电子态</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="274" y1="91" x2="370" y2="91" marker-end="url(#channel-arrow)" class="born-huang-diagram__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(385 31)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="395" height="120" rx="12" class="born-huang-diagram__box born-huang-diagram__box--accent" />
      <text x="197" y="31" text-anchor="middle">coupled state / 耦合态</text>
      <text x="197" y="62" text-anchor="middle">Ψₛ(r,R)=Σᵢ χₛᵢ(R) Ψᵢ(r;R)</text>
      <text x="197" y="93" text-anchor="middle">nuclear channel amplitude × electronic basis state</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="582" y1="169" x2="582" y2="225" marker-end="url(#channel-arrow)" class="born-huang-diagram__arrow" />
    <text x="602" y="201">T̂N acts</text>

    <g transform="translate(40 242)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="105" rx="12" class="born-huang-diagram__box" />
      <text x="110" y="28" text-anchor="middle">χ term</text>
      <text x="110" y="56" text-anchor="middle">Ψᵢ ∇²χᵢ</text>
      <text x="110" y="82" text-anchor="middle">ordinary nuclear kinetic energy</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(300 242)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="105" rx="12" class="born-huang-diagram__box born-huang-diagram__box--accent" />
      <text x="110" y="28" text-anchor="middle">first derivative</text>
      <text x="110" y="56" text-anchor="middle">2(∇χᵢ)·(∇Ψᵢ)</text>
      <text x="110" y="82" text-anchor="middle">Aᵢᵢ′: velocity-like channel coupling</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(560 242)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="105" rx="12" class="born-huang-diagram__box born-huang-diagram__box--accent" />
      <text x="110" y="28" text-anchor="middle">second derivative</text>
      <text x="110" y="56" text-anchor="middle">χᵢ ∇²Ψᵢ</text>
      <text x="110" y="82" text-anchor="middle">Bᵢᵢ′: derivative correction</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="582" y1="225" x2="150" y2="238" marker-end="url(#channel-arrow)" class="born-huang-diagram__arrow" />
    <line x1="582" y1="225" x2="410" y2="238" marker-end="url(#channel-arrow)" class="born-huang-diagram__arrow" />
    <line x1="582" y1="225" x2="670" y2="238" marker-end="url(#channel-arrow)" class="born-huang-diagram__arrow" />
  </svg>

  <dl class="born-huang-diagram__fallback">
    <div>
      <dt>电子基 | Electronic basis</dt>
      <dd>对每个固定核构型 <code>R</code> 求解电子本征态 <code>Ψᵢ(r;R)</code>。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>核通道 | Nuclear channel</dt>
      <dd>系数 <code>χₛᵢ(R)</code> 描述总态在第 <code>i</code> 个电子通道上的核波函数。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>耦合来源 | Coupling origin</dt>
      <dd>核动能对乘积求二阶导数，产生普通核动能、一次导数耦合 <code>A</code> 和二次导数项 <code>B</code>。</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>明确非绝热耦合并非额外添加的经验项，而是核动能作用于随核坐标变化的电子基时由乘积法则产生。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> show that nonadiabatic couplings are generated by the nuclear kinetic operator acting on an electronic basis that depends on nuclear coordinates.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图与语义列表都必须区分 <code>∇²χ</code>、<code>∇χ·∇Ψ</code> 和 <code>χ∇²Ψ</code> 三类项。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> both the diagram and fallback distinguish the <code>∇²χ</code>, <code>∇χ·∇Ψ</code>, and <code>χ∇²Ψ</code> terms.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>图示省略核指标、Cartesian 分量和质量因子；正文方程保留这些量。图形本身不判断某个体系是否可忽略通道耦合。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> nuclear indices, Cartesian components, and mass factors are suppressed here and restored in the equations. The diagram does not decide whether channel couplings are negligible in a real system.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

